 *
 * Description: Set of basic stream aggregates(/ors) defined using the 
 * stream transducer operator strans (i.e. it uses initfn instead of init state).
 * In additions to the definitions of stream aggregators for single valued 
 * streams, easy-to-use facilities are provided and demonstrated how to 
 * element-wise extend the single-valued stream aggregators to vector-valued 
 * streams.   
 *
